,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.8.dev6, 4.8.dev7.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev.mono (e7cfa294a) - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe SSCS buffer and the `sscs_index` are out of sync when there are multiple directional lights with contact shadows and one of these directional lights has its shadow maps disabled. This is because `sscs_index` is only assigned if it is detected that the `shadow_contact_shadows_allow` property is true, but it does not take into account whether the `shadow_enabled` property is also true.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable contact shadows in the project settings.\n2. Add 4 directional lights to your scene.\n3. Make sure to enable both shadow maps and contact shadows on all 4 directional lights.\n4. Disable shadows on 1 of the 4 directional lights.\n5. Play with the contact shadows settings on the directional lights that still have shadows enabled.\n6. Observe how some contact shadows do not correspond to the directional lights.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Re